      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"... I...\" She hesitates. Then, \"Do you know that some of the locals say that there are ancient cities buried beneath Viscara? That there... there's secrets here which are older than even the Republic? I just... I think... the Sergeant told me to keep some of these thoughts to myself. I think I will just... keep them to myself...\" She mutters absentmindedly, looking shakened.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
